    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γο-ερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόος</span>) of
